flowchart LR
    Dev[Developer] -->|push / workflow_dispatch| GA[".github/workflows/publish.yml"]
    GA -->|docker build\n(Dockerfile)| Image["mynameis image"]
    Image -->|docker push| GHCR[(GHCR registry)]
    GA -->|ssh| VM

    subgraph VM["Hetzner VM (terraform/, cloud-init)"]
        Deploy["bin/deploy-remote.sh"]
        Compose["docker compose\n(docker-compose.prod.yml)"]
        Caddy["Caddy\n(TLS termination)"]
        App["mynameis release\n(bin/migrate then bin/server)"]
        SQLite[(SQLite volume)]
        Env[".env\n(SECRET_KEY_BASE, OPENROUTER_API_KEY,\nBASIC_AUTH_*) -- set by hand, never in CI"]
    end

    GHCR -->|docker compose pull| Deploy
    Deploy --> Compose
    Compose --> Caddy
    Compose --> App
    App --> SQLite
    Env -.-> App

    Internet([Internet]) --> Caddy --> App
